│                                  ││    1 // Sorting, as in "Introduction to Algorithms" (Cormen, Leisers…┃ │
│                                  ││    2 // no declarations, blocks by indentation. Try r on a procedure…┃ │
│                                  ││    3 INSERTION-SORT(A, n)                                            ┃ │
│                                  ││    4     for i = 2 to n                                                │
│                                  ││    5         key = A[i]                                                │
│                                  ││    6         // Insert A[i] into the sorted subarray A[1:i - 1].       │
│                                  ││    7         j = i - 1                                                 │
│                                  ││    8         while j > 0 and A[j] > key                                │
│                                  ││    9             A[j + 1] = A[j]                                       │
│                                  ││   10             j = j - 1                                             │
│                                  ││   11         A[j + 1] = key                                            │
│                                  ││   12                                                                   │
│                                  ││   13 MERGE(A, p, q, r)                                                 │
│                                  ││   14     nL = q - p + 1          // length of A[p:q]                   │
│                                  ││   15     nR = r - q              // length of A[q + 1:r]               │
